    "code": "def solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    prices = [150, 152, 149, 153, 155, 157, 160, 162, 165, 167]\n    period = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    smoothing_factor = 2 / (period + 1)\n    ema = sum(prices[:period]) / period\n\n    for price in prices[period:]:\n        ema = (price * smoothing_factor) + (ema * (1 - smoothing_factor))\n\n    answer = round(ema, 2)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n"
